{"t":"DVN","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Devon Energy Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Energy","industry":"Oil & Gas E&P","employees":2200,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://www.devonenergy.com","summary_en":"Devon Energy Corporation, an independent energy company, engages in the exploration, development, and production of oil, natural gas, and natural gas liquids in the United States. The company operates in Delaware Basin located in southeast New Mexico and west Texas, Eagle Ford located in North America, Anadarko Basin located in western Oklahoma, Williston Basin located in North Dakota, and Powder River Basin located in Wyoming. Devon Energy Corporation was founded in 1971 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"독립 에너지 회사인 Devon Energy Corporation은 미국에서 석유, 천연가스 및 천연가스 액체의 탐사, 개발 및 생산에 종사하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 뉴멕시코 남동부와 텍사스 서부에 위치한 델라웨어 분지, 북미에 위치한 이글 포드, 오클라호마 서부에 위치한 애너다코 분지, 노스다코타에 위치한 윌리스턴 분지, 와이오밍에 위치한 파우더 리버 분지에서 사업을 운영하고 있습니다. Devon Energy Corporation은 1971년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":42.88,"mcap":47168000000.0,"pe":10.72,"fpe":7.960096,"peg":null,"ps":2.5114744,"pb":1.1811045,"ev_ebitda":6.512,"div":2.99,"beta":0.477,"hi52":52.71,"lo52":32.06},"fin":{"rev":18780999680.0,"rev_g":0.642,"eps_g":0.44,"gross":0.50349,"op":0.41077,"net":0.17464,"roe":0.11522,"fcf":782625024.0,"cash":950000000.0,"debt":11893000192.0,"de":28.488,"eps":4.0,"feps":5.38687},"own":{"short":0.0252,"inst":0.95675004,"insider":0.00767},"analyst":{"n":26,"mean":61.69231,"median":62.0,"high":74.0,"low":44.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.25,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":5,"buy":22,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":5,"buy":22,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":23,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":3,"buy":21,"hold":3,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-16","Firm